# Ctrl P, "dark": the first match is "Toggle dark and light". Enter runs it and
# the palette closes. The ground changes from the dark theme's (30, 34, 41) to
# the light theme's (250, 248, 243); a region with no text in it is all ground.
# frames 8
# expect theme light
# expect palette 0
# pixels 400 200 500 300 250 248 243 10000
# pixels 400 200 500 300 30 34 41 none
1 key p ctrl
2 text dark
3 key enter
